    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">A?!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Bu nima?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_003_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Kim u?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_004_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Seni eshityapman!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_005_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Koʻzim koʻrmaydi, ammo qulogʻim aldamaydi... Seni eshityapman...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_soundheard_006_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Seni eshityaaaapman!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Bekinmachoq tugadi...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Chiq, chiq, qayerda boʻlsang ham!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_003_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Qocha olmaysan, yoʻq yoʻq yoʻq yoʻq yoʻq, u atrofimizni oʻrab olgan...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_004_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Bu yoqqa kel, nima koʻrganimni senga koʻrsatay.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_005_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Bu tunnellar ularniki. Bu yerga bostirib kirishga qanday jurʼat etding.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_lookingforplayer_006_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Koʻrish ketdi, ketdi koʻrish. Koʻrish ketdi, ketdi koʻrish...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleaving_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Qaytib kel! Qaytib kel! Iltimos, qaytib kel!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleaving_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Meni tashlab ketma!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleaving_003_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Iltimos! Iltimos! Yordam ber! Yordam ber, iltimos!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleaving_004_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Meni tashlab ketma! Iltimos, tashlab ketma!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleavingwithdetonatorhandle_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Sen bilan ishim tugagani yoʻq! Qaytib kel!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleavingwithdetonatorhandle_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Seni topaman! Vaʼda beraman! Topaman!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_playerleavingwithdetonatorhandle_003_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Qaytib kel, qoʻrqoq!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_general_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Laʼnat senga!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_general_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Ogʻriq qoʻlimni ushlab qoladi deb oʻyladingmi? Yoʻq, yoʻq, yoʻq.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_general_003_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Qon, qon va yana qon. Men oʻz ulushimni berdim... Endi sening navbating...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_general_emote_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Xirillaydi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_general_emote_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Xirillaydi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_gas_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Yoʻtaladi] Gaz ichida yashirina olmaysan! [Xirillaydi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_gas_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Yoʻtaladi] Seni eshityapman... [Xirillaydi] Hamon eshityapman!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_damage_burn_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">Kuydiryapti! AAAH!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_death_burn_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Qichqiradi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_death_gas_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Yoʻtaladi va boʻgʻiladi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_death_general_001_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Qichqiradi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="comments_dialogue_death_general_002_toussaintbeaufoy_001">[Qichqiradi]</Entry>
  </CATEGORY>
